# Room 0: Central Command Hub. The player spawns on the ground floor and reaches the themed
# rooms through doors. Only door '1' (-> room 1) is unlocked at the start; every other room is
# locked by default and needs a key. Locked door letters map to room indices:
#   L -> 2, N -> 3, O -> 4, q -> 5, T -> 6, U -> 7 (the fortress).
# Keys are dropped by defeated enemies and sit in end-of-level crates, so the player clears the
# open room first, then spends keys to unlock the rest.
# Layout: a two-tier command deck tower. Each door sits on its own platform reachable by jumping.
name: Command Hub
gravity: 1400
